<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's est 105,000, Wk ago 99,000, Yr ago 104,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent carcass base hogs. Barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 higher than the mid-session Monday. Trade was slow to moderate for moderate to good demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $51.00 per cwt.</p>
